BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:Forged Films
DESCRIPTION:In the remote South Korean village of Hope Harbor\, police chi
 ef Bum-seok and officer Sung-ae are called to investigate a mysterious cr
 eature wreaking havoc on the community. But all is not as it seems\, and 
 perceptions can be misleading. What begins as ignorance plants the seed o
 f disaster\, escalating through human conflict into a tragedy of cosmic p
 roportions.
